msgid "Django documentation"
msgstr "Doiciméid Django"

msgid "Everything you need to know about Django."
msgstr "Gach rud a theastaíonn uait a bheith agat faoi Django."

msgid "First steps"
msgstr "Na chéad chéimeanna"

msgid "Are you new to Django or to programming? This is the place to start!"
msgstr "An bhfuil tú nua do Django nó do ríomhchlárú? Seo é an áit le tosú!"

msgid ""
"**From scratch:** :doc:`Overview <intro/overview>` | :doc:`Installation "
"<intro/install>`"
msgstr ""
"**Ón tús:** :doc:`Forbhreathnú <intro/overview>` | :doc:`Suiteáil <intro/"
"install>`"

msgid ""
"**Tutorial:** :doc:`Part 1: Requests and responses <intro/tutorial01>` "
"| :doc:`Part 2: Models and the admin site <intro/tutorial02>` | :doc:`Part "
"3: Views and templates <intro/tutorial03>` | :doc:`Part 4: Forms and generic "
"views <intro/tutorial04>` | :doc:`Part 5: Testing <intro/tutorial05>` "
"| :doc:`Part 6: Static files <intro/tutorial06>` | :doc:`Part 7: Customizing "
"the admin site <intro/tutorial07>` | :doc:`Part 8: Adding third-party "
"packages <intro/tutorial08>`"
msgstr ""
"**Teagasc:** :doc:`Cuid 1: Iarratais agus freagraí <intro/tutorial01>` "
"| :doc:`Cuid 2: Múnlaí agus an suíomh riaracháin <intro/tutorial02>` "
"| :doc:`Cuid 3: Radhairc agus teimpléid <intro/tutorial03>` | :doc:`Cuid 4: "
"Foirmeacha agus tuairimí cineálacha <intro/tutorial04>` | :doc:`Cuid 5: "
"Tástáil <intro/tutorial05>` | :doc:`Cuid 6: Comhaid statacha <intro/"
"tutorial06>` | :doc:`Cuid 7: An suíomh riaracháin a shaincheapadh <intro/"
"tutorial07>` | :doc:`Cuid 8: Ag cur pacáistí tríú páirtí <intro/tutorial08>`"

msgid ""
"**Advanced Tutorials:** :doc:`How to write reusable apps <intro/reusable-"
"apps>` | :doc:`Writing your first contribution to Django <intro/"
"contributing>`"
msgstr ""
"**Ardchúrsaí Teagaisc:** :doc:`Conas aipeanna ath-inúsáidte a scríobh <intro/"
"reusable-apps>` | :doc:`Do chéad ranníocaíocht a scríobh chuig Django <intro/"
"contributing>`"

msgid "Getting help"
msgstr "Cabhair a fháil"

msgid "Having trouble? We'd like to help!"
msgstr "Ag dtrioblóid? Ba mhaith linn cabhrú!"

msgid ""
"Try the :doc:`FAQ <faq/index>` -- it's got answers to many common questions."
msgstr ""
"Bain triail as an :doc:`FAQ <faq/index>` -- faightear freagraí air ar go "
"leor ceisteanna coitianta."

msgid ""
"Looking for specific information? Try the :ref:`genindex`, :ref:`modindex` "
"or the :doc:`detailed table of contents <contents>`."
msgstr ""
"Ag lorg eolais ar leith? Bain triail as an :ref:`genindex`, :tag:`modindex` "
"nó an :doc:`clár mionsonraithe na n-ábhar <contents>`."

msgid ""
"Not found anything? See :doc:`faq/help` for information on getting support "
"and asking questions to the community."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhfuarthas rud ar bith? Féach :doc:`faq/help` chun eolas a fháil ar "
"thacaíocht a fháil agus ceisteanna a chur ar an bpobal."

msgid "Report bugs with Django in our `ticket tracker`_."
msgstr "Déan tuairisc ar fhabhtanna le Django inár `rianaire ticéad`_."

msgid "How the documentation is organized"
msgstr "Conas a eagraítear na doiciméid"

msgid ""
"Django has a lot of documentation. A high-level overview of how it's "
"organized will help you know where to look for certain things:"
msgstr ""
"Tá go leor doiciméadú ag Django. Cabhróidh forbhreathnú ardleibhéil ar an "
"gcaoi a n-eagraítear é leat fios a bheith agat cá háit a lorgóidh tú rudaí "
"áirithe:"

msgid ""
":doc:`Tutorials </intro/index>` take you by the hand through a series of "
"steps to create a web application. Start here if you're new to Django or web "
"application development. Also look at the \":ref:`index-first-steps`\"."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Teagaisc </intro/index>` tógann tú de láimh trí shraith céimeanna chun "
"feidhmchlár gréasáin a chruthú. Tosaigh anseo má tá tú nua i Django nó "
"forbairt feidhmchlár gréasáin. Breathnaigh freisin ar an \":tag:`index-first-"
"steps`\"."

msgid ""
":doc:`Topic guides </topics/index>` discuss key topics and concepts at a "
"fairly high level and provide useful background information and explanation."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Treoraithe Ábhair </topics/index>` pléann na heochair-ábhair agus na "
"príomhchoincheapa ag leibhéal measartha ard agus soláthraíonn siad faisnéis "
"chúlra agus míniú úsáideach."

msgid ""
":doc:`Reference guides </ref/index>` contain technical reference for APIs "
"and other aspects of Django's machinery. They describe how it works and how "
"to use it but assume that you have a basic understanding of key concepts."
msgstr ""
":doc: `Tá tagairt theicniúil le haghaidh APIanna agus gnéithe eile "
"d'innealra Django i dtreoracha tagartha </ref/index>`. Déanann siad cur síos "
"ar conas a oibríonn sé agus conas é a úsáid ach glacann siad leis go bhfuil "
"tuiscint bhunúsach agat ar phríomhchoincheapa."

msgid ""
":doc:`How-to guides </howto/index>` are recipes. They guide you through the "
"steps involved in addressing key problems and use-cases. They are more "
"advanced than tutorials and assume some knowledge of how Django works."
msgstr ""
":doc: Is oidis iad `treoraithe conas </howto/index>`. Treoraíonn siad tú trí "
"na céimeanna a bhaineann le dul i ngleic le príomhfhadhbanna agus cásanna "
"úsáide. Tá siad níos forbartha ná ranganna teagaisc agus glacann siad roinnt "
"eolais ar conas a oibríonn Django."

msgid "The model layer"
msgstr "An ciseal múnla"

msgid ""
"Django provides an abstraction layer (the \"models\") for structuring and "
"manipulating the data of your web application. Learn more about it below:"
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn Django ciseal astarraingthe (na \"samhlacha\") chun sonraí "
"d'fheidhmchlár gréasáin a struchtúrú agus a ionramháil. Tuilleadh eolais "
"faoi thíos:"

msgid ""
"**Models:** :doc:`Introduction to models <topics/db/models>` | :doc:`Field "
"types <ref/models/fields>` | :doc:`Indexes <ref/models/indexes>` "
"| :doc:`Meta options <ref/models/options>` | :doc:`Model class <ref/models/"
"class>`"
msgstr ""
"**Samhlacha:** :doc:`Réamhrá ar mhúnlaí <topics/db/models>` "
"| :doc:`Cineálacha réimse <ref/models/fields>` | :doc:`Innéacsanna <ref/"
"models/indexes>` | :doc:`Meta roghanna <ref/models/options>` | :doc:`Aicme "
"múnla <ref/models/class>`"

msgid ""
"**QuerySets:** :doc:`Making queries <topics/db/queries>` | :doc:`QuerySet "
"method reference <ref/models/querysets>` | :doc:`Lookup expressions <ref/"
"models/lookups>`"
msgstr ""
"**QuerySets:** :doc:`Fiosruithe a dhéanamh <topics/db/queries>` "
"| :doc:`Tagairt mhodha QuerySet <ref/models/querysets>` | :doc:`Sloinn "
"chuardaigh <ref/models/lookups>`"

msgid ""
"**Model instances:** :doc:`Instance methods <ref/models/instances>` "
"| :doc:`Accessing related objects <ref/models/relations>`"
msgstr ""
"** Samplaí cásanna:** :doc:`Modhanna cásanna <tag/models/cásanna>` "
"| :doc:`Rochtain ar réada gaolmhara <ref/models/relations>`"

msgid ""
"**Migrations:** :doc:`Introduction to Migrations<topics/migrations>` "
"| :doc:`Operations reference <ref/migration-operations>` "
"| :doc:`SchemaEditor <ref/schema-editor>` | :doc:`Writing migrations <howto/"
"writing-migrations>`"
msgstr ""
"**Imirce:** :doc:`Réamhrá ar Imirce <ábhair/imirce>` | :doc:`Tagairt "
"oibríochtaí <ref/migration-operations>` | :doc:`SchemaEditor <ref/schema-"
"editor>` | :doc:`Ag scríobh <howto/writing-migrations>`"

msgid ""
"**Advanced:** :doc:`Managers <topics/db/managers>` | :doc:`Raw SQL <topics/"
"db/sql>` | :doc:`Transactions <topics/db/transactions>` | :doc:`Aggregation "
"<topics/db/aggregation>` | :doc:`Search <topics/db/search>` | :doc:`Custom "
"fields <howto/custom-model-fields>` | :doc:`Multiple databases <topics/db/"
"multi-db>` | :doc:`Custom lookups <howto/custom-lookups>` | :doc:`Query "
"Expressions <ref/models/expressions>` | :doc:`Conditional Expressions <ref/"
"models/conditional-expressions>` | :doc:`Database Functions <ref/models/"
"database-functions>`"
msgstr ""
"**Ard:** :doc:`Bainisteoirí <topics/db/managers>` | :doc:`Raw SQL <topics/db/"
"sql>` | :doc:`Idirbhearta <topics/db/transactions>` | :doc:`Comhiomlán "
"<topics/db/aggregation>` | :doc:`Cuardaigh <topics/db/search>` "
"| :doc:`Réimsí saincheaptha <howto/custom-model-fields>` | :doc:`Multiple "
"databases <topics/db/multi-db>` | :doc:`Fiosruithe saincheaptha <howto/"
"custom-lookups>` | :doc:`Sloinn Iarratas <ref/models/expressions>` "
"| :doc:`Sloinn Choinníollach <ref/models/conditional-expressions>` "
"| :doc:`Feidhmeanna Bunachar Sonraí <ref/models/database-functions>`"

msgid ""
"**Other:** :doc:`Supported databases <ref/databases>` | :doc:`Legacy "
"databases <howto/legacy-databases>` | :doc:`Providing initial data <howto/"
"initial-data>` | :doc:`Optimize database access <topics/db/optimization>` "
"| :doc:`PostgreSQL specific features <ref/contrib/postgres/index>`"
msgstr ""
"**Eile:** :doc:`Bunachair shonraí tacaithe <ref/databases>` "
"| :doc:`Bunachair shonraí oidhreachta <howto/legacy-databases>` "
"| :doc:`Sonraí tosaigh a sholáthar <howto/initial-data>` "
"| :doc:`Uasmhéadaigh rochtain ar bhunachar sonraí <topics/db/optimization>` "
"| :doc:`Gnéithe sonracha PostgreSQL <ref/contrib/postgres/index>`"

msgid "The view layer"
msgstr "An ciseal radharc"

msgid ""
"Django has the concept of \"views\" to encapsulate the logic responsible for "
"processing a user's request and for returning the response. Find all you "
"need to know about views via the links below:"
msgstr ""
"Tá an coincheap \"tuairimí\" ag Django chun an loighic atá freagrach as "
"iarratas úsáideora a phróiseáil agus as an bhfreagra a thabhairt ar ais a "
"chuimsiú. Faigh gach eolas atá uait faoi thuairimí trí na naisc thíos:"

msgid ""
"**The basics:** :doc:`URLconfs <topics/http/urls>` | :doc:`View functions "
"<topics/http/views>` | :doc:`Shortcuts <topics/http/shortcuts>` "
"| :doc:`Decorators <topics/http/decorators>` | :doc:`Asynchronous Support "
"<topics/async>`"
msgstr ""
"**Na bunghnéithe:** :doc:`URLconfs <topics/http/urls>` | :doc:`Féach ar "
"fheidhmeanna <topics/http/views>` | :doc:`Aicearraí <topics/http/shortcuts>` "
"| :doc:`Decorators <topics/http/decorators>` | :doc:`Tacaíocht Aisioncrónach "
"<topics/async>`"

msgid ""
"**Reference:** :doc:`Built-in Views <ref/views>` | :doc:`Request/response "
"objects <ref/request-response>` | :doc:`TemplateResponse objects <ref/"
"template-response>`"
msgstr ""
"**Tagairt:** :doc:`Amharcanna Insuite <ref/views>` | :doc:`Réada iarratais/"
"freagairt <ref/request-response>` | :doc:`Oibiachtaí TemplateResponse <ref/"
"template-response>`"

msgid ""
"**File uploads:** :doc:`Overview <topics/http/file-uploads>` | :doc:`File "
"objects <ref/files/file>` | :doc:`Storage API <ref/files/storage>` "
"| :doc:`Managing files <topics/files>` | :doc:`Custom storage <howto/custom-"
"file-storage>`"
msgstr ""
"**Uaslódálacha comhaid:** :doc:`Forbhreathnú <topics/http/file-uploads>` "
"| :doc:`Oibiachtaí comhaid <ref/files/file>` | :doc:`Storage API <ref/files/"
"storage>` | :doc:`Comhaid a bhainistiú <topics/files>` | :doc:`Stóráil "
"saincheaptha <howto/custom-file-storage>`"

msgid ""
"**Class-based views:** :doc:`Overview <topics/class-based-views/index>` "
