"<topics/class-based-views/mixins>` | :doc:`Tagairt API <ref/class-based-"
"views/index>` | :doc:`Innéacs comhréidh<ref/class-based-views/flattened-"
"index>`"

msgid ""
"**Advanced:** :doc:`Generating CSV <howto/outputting-csv>` "
"| :doc:`Generating PDF <howto/outputting-pdf>`"
msgstr ""
"**Ard:** :doc:`CSV a ghiniúint <howto/outputting-csv>` | :doc:`Gin PDF "
